    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You spent your early years alone in a hut or a monastery far beyond the edge of the nearest settlement. Your only company was the creatures of the forest and the rare visitors who came with supplies and news of the world. That solitude gave you long hours to ponder the mysteries of creation.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Wisdom, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.1M64ZpNOx4YSXXDu]{Healer}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Medicine and Religion</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulHerbalismK]{Herbalism Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepQuartersta]{Quarterstaff}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulHerbalismK]{Herbalism Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBedroll0000]{Bedroll}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBook0000000]{Book} (philosophy), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLamp0000000]{Lamp}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 16 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
